id: pm-gh1394
title: "GH-1394: Define audited owned-subtree replacement for complete-next settings mutations"
description: Complete-next normalized settings callbacks cannot see unknown raw subtree keys. Replacing an owned subtree can retain omitted keys while the normalized preview omits them; provide explicit audited replacement without discarding unrelated foreign settings.
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 2
tags: []
