acceptance_criteria: Owned-subtree replacement intent removes omitted raw keys under the SDK lock/history boundary; Preserve unrelated future fields; Preview accurately describes persisted replacement semantics; Real packed Node and Bun consumers reproduce and verify the intended contract.
